Only the pieces the admin interface uses are vendored, with these changes:

- components/ui/NoahTable.vue: the loading text is a `loadingText` prop instead of fixed English.
- components/ui/NoahModal.vue: the close button label is a `closeLabel` prop.
- components/icons/NoahIcon.vue: adds the console glyphs (overview, players, rooms, plugins,
  opcodes, logs, builds, gear, pause, play) and replaces the sun and moon paths.
- styles/tokens.css: the design tokens of the static edition, plus the scale tokens the Vue
  components read. No web font is imported; the interface uses system fonts only.
- styles/base.css: the reset and utility classes from the Vue edition's main.css, without the
  ambient background wash.
